{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Video Compressor Gold 是一款針對手機儲存空間不足而設計的影片壓縮工具，適合經常拍攝或收藏影片、又想保留更多相片與應用程式的用戶。它原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-30.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>批次壓縮節省儲存空間</h2>\n<p>Video Compressor Gold 可壓縮並優化影片，將檔案大小減少 80% 或以上，亦支援壓縮相片。用戶能快速找出大型影片檔案，從多種預設選項中選擇合適設定，並一次處理多段影片；完成後亦可輕鬆分享已壓縮影片，方便整理及傳送。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-38-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-39-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-40-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-41-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-42-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Video Compressor Gold</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/video-compressor-gold/id1133417250?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T07:00:52.084442+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":304,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T06:50:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T00:18:49.159554+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T06:58:33.500181+00:00","content_hash":"06cc805651888b415e4d2f07a0aa4c7cdb8758bb6095d06ab5ee34a04a1ed4c0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}